@name balance
@aliases bal
$var[user;$mentioned[1;yes]]
$title[$username[$var[user]]'s wallet]
$description[💰 **$numberSeparator[$getUserVar[money;$var[user]]]** coins]
$thumbnail[$userAvatar[$var[user]]]
$color[#f1c40f]
---
@name daily
$cooldown[24h;You already claimed today! Come back in **%time%**.]
$var[amount;$random[100;500]]
$setUserVar[money;$sum[$getUserVar[money];$var[amount]]]
🎁 You got **$var[amount]** coins! New balance: **$getUserVar[money]**
---
@name pay
$argsCheck[>2;Usage: `$prefixpay @user amount`]
$onlyIf[$isInteger[$message[2]]==true;Amount must be a whole number.]
$onlyIf[$message[2]>0;Amount must be positive.]
$onlyIf[$mentioned[1]!=;Mention someone to pay.]
$onlyIf[$mentioned[1]!=$authorID;You can't pay yourself.]
$onlyIf[$getUserVar[money]>=$message[2];You only have $getUserVar[money] coins.]
$setUserVar[money;$sub[$getUserVar[money];$message[2]]]
$setUserVar[money;$sum[$getUserVar[money;$mentioned[1]];$message[2]];$mentioned[1]]
✅ Sent **$message[2]** coins to <@$mentioned[1]>.
---
@name top
$title[🏆 Richest users]
$description[$userLeaderboard[money;10]]
